window.products.push({"id":846013,"name":"suddus White Christmas Lights Outdoor/Indoor, 66ft 200 Led Remote Control Mini Christmas Lights Plug in, Twinkle Lights for Christmas Tree, House, Yar","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":32.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91rBPqzC1VL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[Diamond Shape/ High Brightness] SUDDUS upgraded warm white 200led lights are diamond shape with precision cutting technology. With the light refraction, the brightness of diamond shape the light is far superior to other lights. It will certainly make your Christmas tree the shiniest one. [8 Modes/ Timer] SUDDUS diamond shape lights have 8 light modes: steady on and 7 flashing modes including combination, in waves, sequential, slo-glo, chasing/ flash, slow fade, twinkle/ flash. The timer will keep the light turned on for 6 hours, with a 18-hour off every 24 hours. You can press the timer button twice or turn off the lights to cancel the timer function. [Remote/ Memory Function] It’s much convenient that you don’t need to walk across your yard to switch the mode, adjust brightness or set timer. The remote control range of the diamond shape lights is 110ft/ 33.6m. The built-in memory chip saves your last mode and brightness setting, no need to reset again. [Waterproof/ Safe To Touch] Christmas tree lights and connectors are IP44 waterproof. They can work normally against splashing water from any angle. LED Christmas lights are 29V low voltage. UL certified plug ensure the safety. So it’s safe to touch. [Dark Wire] The dark wire are invisible in Christmas trees and grass. Perfect for indoor and outdoor decorations, like Christmas trees, fireplace, wedding, door frame, patio, balcony, garden, etc. It helps you to create a joyful and merry ambiance at Christmas. [Satisfaction Guarantee] All of our Christmas lights come with 30-day free exchange service and 12-month warranty. And we will be 24/7 online. If you have any questions about this product, please feel free to contact our customer service, we will solve problems for you.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91rBPqzC1VL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"suddus","source_asin":"B08FMKDBY2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-846013","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08FMKDBY2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08FMKDBY2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
