window.products.push({"id":846064,"name":"Bobolyn Handcrafted Mosaic Electric Wax Melts Warmer Candle Waxing Warmer Burner Melt Wax Cube Melter Fragrance Warmer Ideal Gift for Wedding Spa and ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71F+xNvqnLL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Ceramic，glass，concrete HANDCRAFTED AND CLASSIC MOSAIC PATTERN - Handcrafted, classic mosaic pattern, eye-catching whether this wax warmer for scented wax on or off, making the oil burner a perfect addition to any contemporary home, office, gym, spa or studio. Wonderful gift for family and friends. SUPERIOR QUALITY & MATERIAL - The electric oil burner melts aroma wax tarts and fragrances candles rapidly and produces a good amount of scent whilst also illuminating the wax burner with a nice warm glow. And the fragrance can last longer to save wax tarts. This electric wax burner does not get too hot like some warmers that leave a burning smell, low power consumption and environmentally friendly. ELIMINATE UNPLEASANT ODOR - This ceramic oil warmer can help mask unpleasant odors while replacing it with a warm inviting aroma, creating a pleasing and romantic atmosphere when you are working, meeting, reading, sleeping, exercising. Choose your favourite scent to create a seasonal ambience. Our ceramic fragrance warmer has compact size with removable dish, safe, convenient and save time and space. Long lasting and appropriate scentsy eliminates odor for bedroom, bathroom, office, garage, kitchen, basement. EASY AND SAFE OPERATION - Simply plug-in power, turn on the switch. Stable melting temperature will soon fully turn the wax into liquid and the scent permeates through the room, first-time user friendly, very safe for kids, elder and pets. Can be used for both wax cube/tart and essential oils. No flame, soot, or other pollutants, no safety hazards caused by burning flames. THE MOST SPECIAL GIFT CHOICE - Are you looking for a gift that will thrill a loved one on his/her birthday, at anniversaries, at Christmas or Valentine’s? Well, look no further! This stunning wax melts burner will make an eloquent token of your feelings on all occasions, showing off your excellent taste and deep love for the special one.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71F+xNvqnLL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bobolyn","source_asin":"B07Q657V3M","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-846064","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07Q657V3M","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07Q657V3M","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":846065,"name":"Sanomedics Sbt01 Touchfree","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51eUsqeaOzL._AC_.jpg","description":"Taking a child's temperature has historically been a dreaded task. in the past, the procedure has been invasive, regardless of the area of the body used to obtain the reading. afraid or uncomfortable with a strange object being held inside or pushed firmly against their bodies, children often squirm and move, making an accurate reading very difficult to obtain. the touchfree thermometer by sanomedics provides you with a non-invasive way to take your child's temperature - even while they are sleeping! and it's incredibly easy to use. simply aim the unit's sensor toward the forehead, two inches from the skin*, and press the button?and in one second the temperature reading is displayed on the large backlit color led display! also, the device's \"touchfree\" technology allows you to check much more than a person's temperature: the unit can be used to check the temperature of a bottle, food or even bath water!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51eUsqeaOzL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sanomedics","source_asin":"B002TRQLKU","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-846065","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B002TRQLKU","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B002TRQLKU","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
