window.products.push({"id":846296,"name":"ASAKUKI Humidifiers for Large Room, Top Fill Cool & Warm Mist Steam Vaporizer Humidifier with Humidity Control for Bedroom, 5L Ultrasonic Quiet Air Hu","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":119.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71G57bHFdWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"HEALTHIER & 4X POWERFUL HUMIDIFY: ASAKUKI steam type warm mist humidifier offers more delicate and healthy mist by PTC area heating water up to 212℉. The warm mist humidification can balance heated air in cold weather, and efficiently relieve allergy & cold symptoms while keeping your skin moisturized and home at a healthier humidity level. SAFE & PURE STEAM FOR BABY/PET: Through the heating area, boiling water turns into vapor, and then plummets to 122℉ when released, which is safe for a home with a baby or pet. Enjoy clean and fresh air at home! CUSTOMIZE YOUR HUMIDITY: We upgraded the built-in sensor to a more precise external one, which can better detect the ambient humidity and adjust mist speed on time (when your desired RH is reached, the machine will stop running). 40%-90%RH and 3 mist speed levels are available for your different demands. Always keep your room’s relative humidity as you wish. GOOD SLEEP HELPER: The large 5 liters water tank provides up to 50 hours of fine mist, and allows you to sleep soundly and safely every night with the auto-shutoff feature, display-off design, and as low as 20dB nearly silent operation. (in cool mode level 1) HUMIDIFY EVERY CORNER OF YOUR ROOM: With a maximum 500ml/H mist output, the air humidifier can cover an area of 753 sq. ft, suitable for the living room, bedroom, kid's room, greenhouse, etc. HUMIDIFIER & DIFFUSER 2 IN 1: This vaporizer humidifier comes with an aromatherapy box, adding drops of essential oils to the aroma sponge, then you can enjoy comfortable humidity with pleasant scents even in dry weather. EASY REFILL & CLEAN: No need to be tired of flipping over your tank and spilling water with our upgraded top-fill design - pour water directly from the top opening. Detachable parts and included brush allow you thoroughly clean the humidifier.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71G57bHFdWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ASAKUKI","source_asin":"B0B6HRPHHQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-846296","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B6HRPHHQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B6HRPHHQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
