window.products.push({"id":846439,"name":"Vila Blender and Shaker Bottle, 16 Ounce, Lightweight, Portable, Plastic Sipper, Great for Protein Shakes, Eggs, Juice Blends & Baking Mixes, Stainles","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":5.45,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41i04zqSakL._AC_SL1010_.jpg","description":"Advantages of a Blender Bottle Perfect for all types of active people, the Vila Supplement Bottle makes it fast, easy and convenient to blend on the go and start your day the right way. Stay energized and hydrated throughout the day as a clear window with measurement markings let you see how much is left in your bottle with a quick glance. Even if you are only drinking water, feel free to leave the ball inside – it will never rust, chip, or affect your water in any way. As an extra added bonus, the multipurpose drinking bottle also has two removable storage compartments that simply screw onto the bottom of your bottle. These detachable boxes are great for storing protein powder, medicine, vitamins, flavored water packets and healthy snacks like nuts and dried fruit. Key Selling Points: 9” x 3.9” x 3” (23x10x7.8cm) PVC plastic 16oz (450ml) capacity Includes stainless steel mixing ball and 2 storage units Perfect for protein shakes, baking mixes How to Shake and Blend Begin by unscrewing the top of the Vila Shaker Bottle which uses the secure twist and lock technology. Once open, add your liquids like water, juice or low-fat milk. For a baking mix, add your wet ingredients like cream or eggs. Next, add your scoop of protein powder or dry ingredients. Drop the mixing ball into your blender bottle and close the lid tightly. You will know it is completely sealed when you hear the click sound. Begin to shake the bottle and the whisking ball will move around freely inside, instantly blending your mixture. After a couple of minutes, it’s time to pop open the flip top and enjoy your delicious blended drink. Excellent Ideas to Shake and Mix Among the most common concoctions made in the Vila Blender and Shaker Bottle are healthy drinks such as protein shakes, yogurt smoothies and nutritional supplements.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41i04zqSakL._AC_SL1010_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"VILA","source_asin":"B07RGDD61P","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-846439","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07RGDD61P","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07RGDD61P","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
