window.products.push({"id":846467,"name":"saicheng White Makeup Vanity Set with Sliding Lighted Mirror, Dressing Table with 5 Storage Drawers Shelves, Dresser Desk & Cushioned Stool Set for Be","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61MMcS1N8sL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Plenty of storage space: This modren dressing table has 5 drawers, ample space to store your cosmetics, jewelry and daily necessities; 3 compartments provide enough space to display bottled perfumes and other small ornaments Included stools and lights: a stool with a cushion and 10 LED bulbs, the bulbs need to be pasted on the mirror, and the color and brightness of the light can be adjusted Sliding mirror: The vanity mirror is equipped with a sliding track, which is easy to use and saves a lot of space Simple assembly: with detailed installation instructions, simple and convenient Customer service: If you have any problems with the product you received, please contact me by email, I will solve it for you, thank you","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61MMcS1N8sL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"saicheng","source_asin":"B0BTYCMD96","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-846467","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BTYCMD96","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BTYCMD96","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":846468,"name":"1/4 Pound of Yuba River Gold Panning Paydirt","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81M0dmqr4eL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"If you enjoy prospecting this is the paydirt for you! This paydirt will contain flour gold, fine gold, flakes, and maybe even pickers or small nuggets. These paydirt concentrates contain high amounts of black sands! Each bag is also screened down to a quarter inch which classifies out the larger rocks, so you only get high quality concentrates while still getting the chance to get any nuggets! Since this is river paydirt, it may be slightly damp or wet when you receive it. You will be taken on a prospecting journey to the Yuba river in California when you pan this bag of concentrates out. I want you to imagine a hard days work of prospecting on a remote creek and panning your concentrates out to feel the joy and excitement of seeing color in the bottom of your pan. There is no better feeling than the anticipation of slowly taking your time to reveal gold under layers of black sand! The weight of paydirt in each bag is a 1/4 pound or 4 ounces. This is meant for recreation and has no guarantees on the amount of gold in each bag but we do guarantee at least a bit in every bag. The second photo is a sample pan of this paydirt. The third photo is some of the nuggets and pickers that have been found in the area where this paydirt is from! The last photo is of some gold I have prospected from this area, it is beautiful and brightly yellow! We try to get our concentrates from the most profitable areas and periodically test pan to insure our paydirt is producing a good amount of gold! Tips for panning: First, I recommend panning just spoonfuls at a time, just one bag may take over an hour to pan, depending on your skill level. As with any concentrates, pan over a catch basin so you can re-pan for any gold you may have missed. It is pretty easy to let the smaller gold fall out with some of the black sands. If you have never panned before feel free to ask me any questions! Please note we offer the same paydirt in larger sizes! Thanks!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81M0dmqr4eL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"goldnuggetminer","source_asin":"B00JIBJ28S","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-846468","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00JIBJ28S","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00JIBJ28S","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":846469,"name":"Modern Living Addison Velvet Twin Plum Quilt Set","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":72.09,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91G9aFTP50L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Sleep in lush elegance with Modern Living’s Addison velvet quilt set. The quilt and shams are crafted out of tactile velvet on the front and reverse to a silky twisted matte satin fabric. Featuring a directional quilt stitch, the quilt and shams feature a ½” twisted matte satin all-around binding for a tidy finish. Finishing the look is the circular, tufted throw pillow made with the same velvet material. This pillow is stuffed with 100% polyester fill and features a ¼” covered cord piping around its edge. This set is available in a versatile palette of rich colors: Teal, Plum, Gray, Navy, and the quilt and shams are lightly filled with 100% polyester fabric - perfect for year round comfort. 100% polyester outer 100% polyester fill Envelope closure on shams Available in Twin, Full/Queen and King sizes Twin set includes quilt, one standard sham, and one decorative pillow Full/Queen set includes one quilt, two standard shams, and one decorative pillow King set includes one quilt, two king shams, and one decorative pillow Twin measures 66”W x 88”L Full/Queen Measures 88”W x 90”L King measures 102”W x 90”L Standard sham measures 20”W x 26”L King sham measures 20”W x 36”L Decorative throw pillow measures 16”W x 16”L (round)","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91G9aFTP50L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Modern Living","source_asin":"B07VWCB9YK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-846469","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07VWCB9YK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07VWCB9YK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
