window.products.push({"id":846482,"name":"Tiptiper Full Size Bed Frame with LED Headboard, 2 USB Charging Station, Platform Bed Frame with Storage Drawers, No Box Spring Needed, Easy Assembly,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":189.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81mTMAB95nL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Headboard with RGB LED Lights】:The LED lights can be controlled by both remote control and mobile APP. With APP control, the LED light has more than 60,000 colors to choose.The brightness can be adjusted, and there are other modes for you to choose: style mode, music mode, microphone mode. In addition, there is a timing function, which can preset the time to turn on and off the LED light. 【2 USB Charging Station】:The power strip built into the headboard has 2 USB ports, making it very convenient for you to charge phone, tablet, headphones and other electronic devices within your reach or use a book light to easily read while lying in bed. 【Adjustable Height LED Headboard】:Adjustable Height :41’’-44’’. It can fit full size mattress in different thickness. This modern platform bed frame features tufted design and upholstered in high-quality linen fabric, skin-friendly, breathable, and the headboard is expertly constructed with dense foam padding for the night after night of restful sleep. 【4 Under bed Storage Drawers】:We designed this solid wood storage bed with 4 under-bed drawers so that you can enjoy a well-kept space no matter what size your bedroom is. These drawers are the very best, and a joy to hold everything from linens and summer clothes to photo albums and toys, putting laundry away has never been so pleasurable. This Dark Grey Linen Fabric Upholstered Storage Bed with Drawers brings classic style and convenient functionality to any room. 【No Box Spring Needed】:The bottom part of this platform bed full has a sturdy wood and metal support structure system, provide a flat and firm structure that offers a stable surface for your mattress. The wood and metal foundation frame supports latex, memory foam, or mattress very well. This means that your bed can support any kind of full-size mattress that maximizes your comfort. No need the box spring.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81mTMAB95nL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Tiptiper","source_asin":"B0BG1FHZNL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-846482","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BG1FHZNL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BG1FHZNL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":846483,"name":"Harley-Davidson Heritage Stainless Steel Insulated Cup w/Straw, Black & Silver","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":37.5,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41nAfJwnTTL._AC_SL1005_.jpg","description":"Harley-Davidson Heritage Stainless Steel Insulated Cup w/ Straw, 2SSC4908. This insulated stainless steel cup holds 16 oz. of hot or cold beverages. Also has a great lid that doesn't spill or leak, with reusable straw. Keeps drinks cold for up to 12 hours and hot for up to 6 hours. Hand wash only.Evergreen Enterprises is a true family business, started 21 years ago with their parents in Richmond Va, hand-making decorative flags in the garage. Now have a dedicated sales force across the United States and Canada with an office in Ningbo, China. Have become the world's leader in decorative flags, as well as offering quality and value positions in drink ware, home decor, garden and gifts. Goals today remain the same as they were when it started in 1993, to enhance life by offering quality products known for their beauty and functionality.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41nAfJwnTTL._AC_SL1005_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Harley-Davidson","source_asin":"B07KL5TGLY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-846483","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07KL5TGLY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07KL5TGLY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
