window.products.push({"id":846514,"name":"Collapse-it Silicone Food Storage Containers - BPA Free Airtight Silicone Lids, 4 Piece Set of 6-Cup Collapsible Lunch Box Containers - Oven, Microwav","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":44.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81cTBYnSv+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Leftover Lovers (6 Cup) – Perfect for storing dinner leftovers or portioning larger meals for your weekly meal prep, this set includes four 6 cup containers. Each Collapse-it comes with a vacuum sealing lid fitted with a vent tab for safe microwaving. Save 50% More Space - Collapsible & stackable food storage containers allow for optimal minimalist organization, and fit neatly into nearly every size cabinet or drawer. Expand silicone containers to utilize for meal prep, saving leftovers, or cooking & baking. You can even use Collapse-it as your new favorite lunch box! Microwave, Dishwasher, Oven, & Freezer Safe - Throw all of your other sub-par containers out! Collapse-it does it all. The amazing durability of these containers allows you to toss your leftovers straight from the freezer into the oven. Collapse-it containers will not crack or break like conventional plastic or glass food storage containers. Leftovers That Last - The secret to long-lasting food storage is an airtight seal. Collapse-it is one of the only container sets on the market with silicone (not plastic), patented & leak proof vacuum seal lids that give you airtight storage. The dual-function lid also has a venting option for heating up food in the microwave. BPA Free, 100% Food Grade Silicone - Make the best choice for long-term health! Plastics contain harmful chemicals that can be released into your food upon contact. Silicone is made primarily of inert silicone (sand) & oxygen. Not only is it better for you, it's better for the environment too!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81cTBYnSv+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Collapse-it","source_asin":"B0C1TG9V7W","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-846514","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C1TG9V7W","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C1TG9V7W","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
