window.products.push({"id":846527,"name":"Force Magnet - 10 Pack Magnetic Hooks - Sturdy, Protective & Versatile - Organize Your Home, Office, Classroom & More - Perfect for Cruise Ship Holida","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Z3ETtvfNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"TRANSFORM CLUTTER INTO CLEVER DESIGN: You might be surprised to discover that a few simple magnetic hooks can restore order to different areas of your home. Display cooking utensils or pots and pans in your kitchen or hang hand towels and tools. A magnet hook provide endless organization solutions. ENTER WITH EASE: These magnetic hooks are perfect for entryways, mudrooms, and areas that are prone to collecting small objects and mess. Hang and organize everyone’s keys. Store your hats and scarves in the wintertime. Stop the overwhelm of a messy entrance every time you arrive home. Choose from three neutral colors of hook magnets: black, white, or chrome. CHOOSE PROTECTION OVER POWER: There are a ton of super strong magnets with hooks on the market. In fact they’re so strong they can damage surfaces, pinch fingers, and hurt children because they snap too hard into place. Our strong magnet hooks hold many household and office items up to 20 lbs in direct pull on a 3 inch thick steel plate. Plus, they come with bonus no-scratch pads to protect your surfaces. GET HOOKED ON VERSATILITY: These magnetic hooks are ideal for organizing your office or classroom. They also work wonders in cruise ship cabins, BBQs, in lockers, holding seasonal decorations, and in any other area that has a magnetic surface and needs some order. The great thing is that they’re completely open-ended. That means you can move them around as you want and change things up regularly. MONEY BACK GUARANTEE: You’ll love how well these magnetic hooks put some order back in your life. That’s why we offer a generous guarantee with your purchase. If you’re not happy with these hooks, let us know within 60 days and we’ll give you a full refund under our Hooked-And-Happy Guarantee. So buy now, knowing your purchase is protected.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Z3ETtvfNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"FORCE MAGNET","source_asin":"B074JKL5YS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-846527","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B074JKL5YS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B074JKL5YS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
