window.products.push({"id":846935,"name":"RACPNEL 5Ft Pop Up Tinsel Christmas Tree with Colorful Sequin, Lights, Tree Topper & Tree Skirt, Collapsible Artificial Pencil Christmas Tree, Holiday","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":16.54,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81YfbvReFkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【All-in-one Tinsel Christmas Tree】If you need an easy and slim christmas tree, this pencil christmas tree will be your perfect choice. It is made of premium tinsel and comes with 30 Balls Ornaments, 40 colorful LED lights, a tree topper, a tree skirt, 12 little gifts and 24 bows. You don't need to buy any additional decorations, this pop up christmas tree set is bright and exquisite enough. The LED lights has 8 modes and will turn off automatically after working 6 hours (battery not included). 【Suitable for Various Spaces】The height of this skinny tall christmas tree is 5 feet. The bottom diameter is 1.08ft. It is easy to fit various places including narrow spaces at home, small apartment, office, classroom. As a perfect indoor retro Christmas decorations, it can be placed nearby fireplace, window, stairs, sofa, or any corner in living room, bedroom, balcony. For outdoor, we suggest to place it at front door, porch, Christmas entrance (don't expose it in bad weather or strong wind). 【Easy to Set Up or Store】Different from traditional christmas tree, this collapsible christmas tree is in pull-up design. Refer to the set up steps shown in the picture, it only takes a few minutes to assemble this thin christmas tree, without any tool. Disassembly is also very quick. You can fold up the christmas tree in a box for the next Christmas. It won't take up a large storage space, also portable for travel. 【Safe & Durable Christmas Tree】This pencil artificial christmas tree is made of premium tinsel, stainless steel, and thickening plastic. The materials are sturdy and durable. The structure is also stable. So it is not easy to be out of shape. Most important of all, everything is safe and non-toxic. The usb LED lights are also well made for reuse. You can save it for the next festival or daily indoor decorations. 【Inject Christmas Spirit】This pop up Christmas tree is eyes-catching both in the day and at night. It is a great addition to your outdoor or indoor Christmas decorations tree. Get it to inject the Christmas spirit and create a strong Christmas atmosphere in your house, apartment, or office. If you need any help about this foldable xmas tree with lights, please feel free to contact us. Any question will be replied within 24 hours. Merry Christmas!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81YfbvReFkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"RACPNEL","source_asin":"B09B6BLB93","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-846935","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09B6BLB93","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09B6BLB93","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
