window.products.push({"id":846989,"name":"Oursson Food Containers, Salad Container for Lunch with Lids Airtight, BPA Free, Lunchbox – Reusable and Practical – Transparent Snack Containers with","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71wrwbwqEIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Practical. With our food storage containers, you don’t need to worry! They are dishwasher, freezer, microwave-safe & stain-resistant which means your food storage container set will last long & save money. Enjoy delicious and well-prepared meals anywhere you are! Safe. We have designed top-quality food storage containers with lids that ensure airtight sealing and all are made of BPA-free plastic, which is odorless and food-grade to ensure safe food storage. They are non-toxic, durable, resilient, and ready to withstand everyday wear and tear. The containers have been tested to ensure superior quality! Versatile. Containers are the perfect size, perfectly stackable and nesting & food is easily identified thanks to its transparent design - just right for a wide range of foods, such as main courses, salads or a refreshing fruit snack, slime, veggie soups, to-go lunches, snacks, fruits, vegetables, liquid foods, you know exactly what you’re grabbing when you reach into the fridge. Save space and secure closure. Stacking your food prep neatly away in your cabinet and since they’re all the same size, you get great portion control. Perfect for healthy eating, meal prepping, weight watchers, women, men, kids, athletes, fitness, and more. The containers provide protection for your food while maintaining it fresh and delicious. Store your food for later or prepare lunch ahead of time! Shatterproof. Withstand 165lbs of pressure because they are made to last and reusable as many times as you need. Our sturdy containers withstand from -11F – 257F (-24C – 125C) therefore will be no plastic melting into your soup, warping from the microwave, or cracking in the freezer. Pack your meal for trips or picnics in Oursson food storage containers!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71wrwbwqEIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Oursson","source_asin":"B08M6724Y9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-846989","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08M6724Y9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08M6724Y9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
